<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P03/current/C017/>
        rdf:type               skos:Concept;
        dce:identifier         "SDN:P03::C017";
        dc:date                "2003-06-10 15:23:21.0";
        dc:identifier          "SDN:P03::C017";
        pav:authoredOn         "2003-06-10 15:23:21.0";
        pav:hasCurrentVersion  <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P03/current/C017/1/>;
        pav:version            "1";
        void:inDataset         <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/.well-known/void>;
        owl:deprecated         "false";
        owl:versionInfo        "1";
        skos:altLabel          "";
        skos:broader           <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P23/current/MD006/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P08/current/DS02/>;
        skos:definition        "This group incorporates the parameters relating to the fatty acid content of sediment or suspended particulate material. Contents are expressed either as 'concentrations' (SPM fatty acid per unit volume of water) or 'contents' (quantity of fatty acid per unit mass of sediment or SPM).  Fatty acids are considered as the naturally occurring continuous chain, saturated and unsaturated aliphatic acids. In their ester form these are the constituents of the fats, waxes and oils of plants and animals. Simpler carboxylic acids with an alkyl or alkenyl group, sometimes loosely termed 'fatty acids' are not included."@en;
        skos:definition        "Ce groupe incorpore les paramètres relatifs au contenu en acides gras des sédiments ou des particules en suspension. Les contenus sont exprimés soit en 'concentrations' (acide gras MSP par unité de volume d'eau) soit en 'teneurs' (quantité d'acide gras par unité de masse de sédiment ou de MSP). Les acides gras sont considérés comme les acides aliphatiques saturés et insaturés à chaîne continue naturellement présents. Sous forme d'esters, ce sont les constituants des graisses, cires et huiles des plantes et des animaux. Les acides carboxyliques plus simples avec un groupe alkyle ou alcényle, parfois vaguement appelés 'acides gras', ne sont pas inclus."@fr ;
        skos:notation          "SDN:P03::C017";
        skos:note              "accepted"@en;
        skos:prefLabel         "Fatty acids"@en;
        skos:prefLabel         "Acides gras"@fr ;
        skos:related           <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/ICHM/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/F001/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/LIBI/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/CD10/> .

<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P03/current/C010/>
        rdf:type               skos:Concept;
        dce:identifier         "SDN:P03::C010";
        dc:date                "2003-06-10 15:23:21.0";
        dc:identifier          "SDN:P03::C010";
        pav:authoredOn         "2003-06-10 15:23:21.0";
        pav:hasCurrentVersion  <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P03/current/C010/1/>;
        pav:version            "1";
        void:inDataset         <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/.well-known/void>;
        owl:deprecated         "false";
        owl:sameAs             <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/OD1/current/C02/>;
        owl:versionInfo        "1";
        skos:altLabel          "";
        skos:broader           <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P23/current/MD006/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P08/current/DS02/>;
        skos:definition        "This group incorporates the state variables that describe the concentration of dissolved inorganic carbon and the status of the equilibrium between this and the atmospheric carbon dioxide concentration.  These are:   Carbon dioxide partial pressure/fugacity.  Total alkalinity.  pH  Dissolved inorganic carbon (TCO 2 )   The group also includes parameters that are essential for the interpretation of the data, such as the temperature at which a parameter was collected or to which it has been recalculated."@en;
        skos:definition        "Ce groupe incorpore les variables d'état qui décrivent la concentration de carbone inorganique dissous et l'état de l'équilibre entre celle-ci et la concentration de dioxyde de carbone atmosphérique. Ce sont : pression partielle/fugacité du dioxyde de carbone ; alcalinité totale ; pH ; carbone inorganique dissous (TCO2). Le groupe inclut aussi des paramètres essentiels pour l'interprétation des données, comme la température à laquelle un paramètre a été collecté ou à laquelle il a été recalculé."@fr ;
        skos:narrower          <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/TCO2/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/ALKY/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/PCO2/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/CCPW/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/PHLT/>;
        skos:notation          "SDN:P03::C010";
        skos:note              "accepted"@en;
        skos:prefLabel         "Carbonate system"@en;
        skos:prefLabel         "système carbonaté"@fr ;
        skos:related           <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/ACO2/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/ICHM/> .

<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P03/current/C055/>
        rdf:type               skos:Concept;
        dce:identifier         "SDN:P03::C055";
        dc:date                "2003-06-10 15:23:21.0";
        dc:identifier          "SDN:P03::C055";
        pav:authoredOn         "2003-06-10 15:23:21.0";
        pav:hasCurrentVersion  <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P03/current/C055/1/>;
        pav:version            "1";
        void:inDataset         <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/.well-known/void>;
        owl:deprecated         "false";
        owl:versionInfo        "1";
        skos:altLabel          "";
        skos:broader           <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P23/current/MD006/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P08/current/DS02/>;
        skos:definition        "This group is designed to bring together parameters pertaining to concentrations of extremely toxic organic chemicals in air, water, SPM, sediment or biological material. It has been set up as an alternative miscellaneous APG to 'Other Organic Chemical Measurements' to assist searches for environmentally significant substances.  The inclusion of a parameter in this grouping has to be subjective to some extent. The following types of substance have been included for the current (May 2003) version of the BODC Parameter Dictionary.   Polychlorobiphenols (PCBs)  Pesticides  Herbicides  Anti-fouling agents"@en;
        skos:definition        "Ce groupe est conçu pour rassembler les paramètres relatifs aux concentrations de produits chimiques organiques extrêmement toxiques dans l'air, l'eau, la MSP, les sédiments ou le matériau biologique. Il a été mis en place comme APG divers de substitution à 'Autres mesures de chimie organique' pour faciliter les recherches de substances significatives pour l'environnement. L'inclusion d'un paramètre dans ce regroupement doit être subjective dans une certaine mesure. Les types de substances suivants ont été inclus pour la version actuelle (mai 2003) du dictionnaire de paramètres BODC : polychlorobiphényles (PCB) ; pesticides ; herbicides ; agents anti-biofouling."@fr ;
        skos:narrower          <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/OD1/current/BIOTOX/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/OD1/current/CONT/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/SCOC/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/PCHW/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/PESD/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/BCPB/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/SPCB/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/PPCB/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/PHSE/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/SCAH/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/PCAH/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/WCOC/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/OMPW/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/BCOC/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/OMWC/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/PHBI/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/PPWC/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/PEBI/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/PEWB/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/OMBI/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/PCOC/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/BCAH/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/PHWB/>;
        skos:notation          "SDN:P03::C055";
        skos:note              "accepted"@en;
        skos:prefLabel         "PCBs and organic micropollutants"@en;
        skos:prefLabel         "PCB et micropolluants organiques"@fr ;
        skos:related           <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/ICHM/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P23/current/MD008/> .

