<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P03/current/B005/>
        rdf:type               skos:Concept;
        dce:identifier         "SDN:P03::B005";
        dc:date                "2003-06-10 15:23:21.0";
        dc:identifier          "SDN:P03::B005";
        pav:authoredOn         "2003-06-10 15:23:21.0";
        pav:hasCurrentVersion  <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P03/current/B005/1/>;
        pav:version            "1";
        void:inDataset         <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/.well-known/void>;
        owl:deprecated         "false";
        owl:sameAs             <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/OD1/current/PATHOGEN/>;
        owl:versionInfo        "1";
        skos:altLabel          "";
        skos:broader           <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P08/current/DS01/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P23/current/MD002/>;
        skos:definition        "This group incorporates all state variables pertaining to bacteria (Kingdom Monera)and viruses. Note that Monera includes both Phylum Bacteria and Phylum Cyanophycota (cyanobacteria but sometimes called blue-green algae).  Most parameters in this group express the abundance, either as cell counts or biomass, of various types of bacteria or viruses. However, the group also includes parameters that describe any other property of these entities that are  not rates or fluxes  . Examples include cell size, cell volume and the proportion of the population associated with the particulate phase."@en;
        skos:definition        "Ce groupe incorpore toutes les variables d'état relatives aux bactéries (Règne Monera) et aux virus. Notez que Monera inclut à la fois le Phylum Bacteria et le Phylum Cyanophycota (cyanobactéries parfois appelées algues bleu-vert). La plupart des paramètres de ce groupe expriment l'abondance, soit en comptages cellulaires soit en biomasse, de divers types de bactéries ou de virus. Cependant, le groupe inclut aussi des paramètres qui décrivent toute autre propriété de ces entités qui n'est pas un taux ou un flux. Des exemples incluent la taille cellulaire, le volume cellulaire et la proportion de la population associée à la phase particulaire."@fr ;
        skos:narrower          <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/BATC/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/BDWC/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/BATX/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/UPTH/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/BABI/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/TBGZ/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/BAUC/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/WDNA/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/BNTC/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/GREF/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/BPBP/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/BNTX/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/VIRU/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/BNUC/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/CBCC/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/BATT/>;
        skos:notation          "SDN:P03::B005";
        skos:note              "accepted"@en;
        skos:prefLabel         "Bacteria and viruses"@en ;
        skos:prefLabel         "Bactéries et virus"@fr .

