<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P03/current/C040/>
        rdf:type               skos:Concept;
        dce:identifier         "SDN:P03::C040";
        dc:date                "2003-06-10 15:23:21.0";
        dc:identifier          "SDN:P03::C040";
        pav:authoredOn         "2003-06-10 15:23:21.0";
        pav:hasCurrentVersion  <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P03/current/C040/1/>;
        pav:version            "1";
        void:inDataset         <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/.well-known/void>;
        owl:deprecated         "false";
        owl:sameAs             <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/OD1/current/NUTS/>;
        owl:versionInfo        "1";
        skos:altLabel          "";
        skos:broader           <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P23/current/MD006/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P08/current/DS02/>;
        skos:definition        "This group contains parameter codes describing the concentrations of the substances that provide the essential basic elements - nitrogen, phosphorus and silicon - to the phytoplankton. The species covered are:   Nitrogen - nitrate, nitrite, ammonium and urea.  Phosphorus - orthophosphate  Silicon - hydrosilicic acid, commonly termed 'silicate'.   The grouping also covers uncalibrated analytical or in-situ instrument outputs, such as monochromatic optical absorbances at the appropriate wavelengths for nutrient determination."@en;
        skos:definition        "Ce groupe contient les codes de paramètres décrivant les concentrations des substances qui fournissent les éléments de base essentiels - azote, phosphore et silicium - au phytoplancton. Les espèces couvertes sont : azote - nitrate, nitrite, ammonium et urée ; phosphore - orthophosphate ; silicium - acide hydrosilicique, communément appelé 'silicate'. Le regroupement couvre aussi les sorties analytiques ou d'instruments in-situ non calibrées, comme les absorbances optiques monochromatiques aux longueurs d'onde appropriées pour la détermination des nutriments."@fr ;
        skos:inScheme          <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/scheme/NETMAR_OCEAN/current/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/scheme/NETOC_PARAM/current/>;
        skos:narrower          <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/AMUP/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/AMOX/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/NTPW/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/PHUP/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/UREA/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/NUTV/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/SAMO/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/NTUP/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/SLCA/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/NTRA/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/PHOS/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/NTRI/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/TDIN/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/AMON/>;
        skos:notation          "SDN:P03::C040";
        skos:note              "accepted"@en;
        skos:prefLabel         "Nutrients"@en;
        skos:prefLabel         "nutriments"@fr ;
        skos:related           <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/ICHM/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P23/current/MD008/> .

<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P03/current/O005/>
        rdf:type               skos:Concept;
        dce:identifier         "SDN:P03::O005";
        dc:date                "2003-06-10 15:23:21.0";
        dc:identifier          "SDN:P03::O005";
        pav:authoredOn         "2003-06-10 15:23:21.0";
        pav:hasCurrentVersion  <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P03/current/O005/1/>;
        pav:version            "1";
        void:inDataset         <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/.well-known/void>;
        owl:deprecated         "false";
        owl:versionInfo        "1";
        skos:altLabel          "";
        skos:broader           <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P08/current/DS06/>;
        skos:definition        "This group contains parameter codes that relate to the rate of transfer of material across real or virtual interfaces. The current (May 2003) BODC Parameter Dictionary includes two types of flux:   Vertical fluxes of mass, chemical species and biological entities through the water column (sediment trap fluxes).  Fluxes of chemical species between the water column and the underlying sediment, including sediment oxygen demand.   However, other categories, such as the estuary discharge fluxes, are envisaged in the future.  Note that this APG has been given 'priority' status to enable modellers to easily ascertain the extent of rate variable availability. Flux parameters are included in this APG in preference to any other APG that might seem appropriate."@en;
        skos:definition        "Ce groupe contient les codes de paramètres relatifs au taux de transfert de matériau à travers des interfaces réelles ou virtuelles. Le dictionnaire de paramètres BODC actuel (mai 2003) inclut deux types de flux : les flux verticaux de masse, d'espèces chimiques et d'entités biologiques à travers la colonne d'eau (flux de pièges à sédiments) ; les flux d'espèces chimiques entre la colonne d'eau et les sédiments sous-jacents, incluant la demande en oxygène des sédiments. Cependant, d'autres catégories, comme les flux de décharge estuarienne, sont envisagées à l'avenir. Notez que cet APG a reçu un statut 'priorité' pour permettre aux modélisateurs de facilement évaluer l'étendue de la disponibilité des variables de taux. Les paramètres de flux sont inclus dans cet APG de préférence à tout autre APG qui pourrait sembler approprié."@fr ;
        skos:narrower          <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/OD1/current/SEDFLUX/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/AAFX/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/CFTM/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/SICO/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/FPFX/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/SCDO/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/PNFX/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/MSFX/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/A01X/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/LIFX/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/PCFX/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/AXFX/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/CBFX/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/SAMO/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/MLFX/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/ATDP/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/RVDS/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/HFLX/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/ATEM/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/FDMS/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/OPFX/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/TCFX/>;
        skos:notation          "SDN:P03::O005";
        skos:note              "accepted"@en;
        skos:prefLabel         "Fluxes"@en;
        skos:prefLabel         "Flux"@fr ;
        skos:related           <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P23/current/MD005/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P23/current/MD006/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P23/current/MD003/> .

<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P03/current/C025/>
        rdf:type               skos:Concept;
        dce:identifier         "SDN:P03::C025";
        dc:date                "2003-06-10 15:23:21.0";
        dc:identifier          "SDN:P03::C025";
        pav:authoredOn         "2003-06-10 15:23:21.0";
        pav:hasCurrentVersion  <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P03/current/C025/1/>;
        pav:version            "1";
        void:inDataset         <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/.well-known/void>;
        owl:deprecated         "false";
        owl:versionInfo        "1";
        skos:altLabel          "";
        skos:broader           <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P23/current/MD006/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P08/current/DS02/>;
        skos:definition        "This group contains parameter codes describing the concentrations of the compounds of carbon and hydrogen. All compounds conforming to this definition are placed in this APG, including aromatic compounds, even polycyclic aromatic hydrocarbons traditionally categorised as 'pollutants'. This is to circumvent problems deciding which hydrocarbons are pollutants and which are not."@en;
        skos:definition        "Ce groupe contient les codes de paramètres décrivant les concentrations des composés de carbone et d'hydrogène. Tous les composés conformes à cette définition sont placés dans cet APG, incluant les composés aromatiques, même les hydrocarbures aromatiques polycycliques traditionnellement classés comme 'polluants'. Ceci pour contourner les problèmes de décision sur quels hydrocarbures sont des polluants et lesquels ne le sont pas."@fr ;
        skos:narrower          <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/OD1/current/CONT/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/SALK/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/PCHW/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/SCAH/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/OHAT/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/AEYN/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/AALK/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/OHWC/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/BCAH/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/AQYN/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/DALK/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/PCAH/>;
        skos:notation          "SDN:P03::C025";
        skos:note              "accepted"@en;
        skos:prefLabel         "Hydrocarbons"@en ;
        skos:prefLabel         "hydrocarbures"@fr .

